criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Patient with suspected OSA, new diagnosis of OSA (Apnea-hypopnea index, AHI, ≥ 5), or OSA with failure or refusal of first-line treatment;
* PSG testing within 1 year or planned in the future;
* Willingness to delay or forego first-line OSA treatment or stop current OSA treatment for 3-4 months;
* Ability to follow directions and perform the required exercises;
* At least 18 years of age;
* DEERS eligible

Exclusion Criteria:

* Current use of OSA treatment;
* Medical comorbidities that require restricting fluid intake (e.g., dysphagia, renal disease, liver disease, hyponatremia);
* Severe nasal obstruction;
* Severe ankyloglossia;
* Craniofacial abnormality;
* Severe pulmonary disease;
* Severe post-traumatic stress disorder;
* Very severe insomnia;
* Body mass index (BMI) ≥35 kg/m2
